<title>SWEDEN: Volvo sees 3.0 bln SKR profit from sale.</title>
<headline>Volvo sees 3.0 bln SKR profit from sale.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Volvo AB said on Friday that the sale of its stake in drinks company Pripps Ringnes to Norway's Orkla would give the group a profit of 3.0 billion crowns.</p>
<p>&quot;Volvo will receive a total of 4.7 billion crowns and the transaction carries a group profit for Volvo of 3.0 billion crowns,&quot; Volvo said in a statement.</p>
</text>
